Valkey 9.1 release notes
========================

Upgrade urgency levels:

| Level    | Meaning                                                             |
|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
| LOW      | No need to upgrade unless there are new features you want to use.   |
| MODERATE | Program an upgrade of the server, but it's not urgent.              |
| HIGH     | There is a critical bug that may affect a subset of users. Upgrade! |
| CRITICAL | There is a critical bug affecting MOST USERS. Upgrade ASAP.         |
| SECURITY | There are security fixes in the release.                            |

Valkey 9.1.0-rc1 - Released Mon Mar 09 00:00:00 2026
-------------------------------------

Upgrade urgency LOW: This is the first release candidate of Valkey 9.1.0, with
new features, performance improvements, and bug fixes.

### New Features
* Database-level access control by @dvkashapov (#2309)
* Adds HGETDEL support to Valkey by @roshkhatri (#2851)
* HSETEX: Support NX/XX flags by @hanxizh9910 (#2668)
* Add prefix-aware ACL permission checks and new module API by @eifrah-aws (#2796)
* New INFO section for scripting engines by @rjd15372 (#2738)
* Move Lua scripting engine into a Valkey module by @rjd15372 (#2858)
* Configurable DB hash seed for SCAN family commands consistency by @sarthakaggarwal97 (#2608)
* Adding json support for log-format config by @jbergstroem (#1791)
* Automatic TLS reload by @yang-z-o (#3020)
* Support TLS authentication using SAN URI by @yang-z-o (#3078)
* Add server side TLS certificate expiry tracking and INFO telemetry by @YiwenZhang12 (#2913)
* Add option to use libbacktrace for backtraces in crash reports by @rainsupreme (#3034)

### Commands
* Makes `CLUSTER KEYSLOT` available in standalone mode by @stockholmux (#3040)
* HSETEX - Always issue keyspace notifications after validation by @ranshid (#3001)

### Performance/Efficiency
* Optimize zset memory usage by embedding element in skiplist by @chzhoo (#2508)
* Remove internal server object pointer overhead in small strings by @rainsupreme (#2516)
* Optimize skiplist query efficiency by embedding the skiplist header by @chzhoo (#2867)
* Improve performance during rehashing by @chzhoo (#3073)
* Optimize SREM/ZREM/HDEL to pause auto shrink when deleting multiple items by @enjoy-binbin (#3144)
* Abort and swap the tables if ht1 is very full during the hashtable shrink rehashing by @enjoy-binbin (#3175)
* Track net bytes only if commandlog-request-larger-than != -1 by @dvkashapov (#3086)
* Enable HW clock by default by @dvkashapov (#3103)

### Cluster and Replication
* Fail to save the cluster config file will not exit the process by @enjoy-binbin (#1032)
* Add support for Atomic Slot Migration to CLI by @murphyjacob4 (#2755)
* Support whole cluster info for INFO command in cluster section by @soloestoy (#2876)
* Replace info cluster info in a dedicated new section by @ranshid (#2964)
* Add remaining_repl_size field in CLUSTER GETSLOTMIGRATIONS output by @enjoy-binbin (#3135)
* Add logging helper function to print node's ip:port when nodename not explicitly set by @zhijun42 (#2777)
* Dual-channel-replication announces itself at replica-announce-ip if configured by @jdheyburn (#2846)
* Show replica dual-channel replication buffer memory in INFO MEMORY and MEMORY STATS by @enjoy-binbin (#2924)
* Add rdb_transmitted to replstateToString so that we can see it in INFO by @enjoy-binbin (#2833)

### Module API
* Add ValkeyModule_ClusterKeySlotC by @bandalgomsu (#2984)
* Add more client info flags to module API by @martinrvisser (#2868)
* Block module unload when ACL references module subcommands by @sachinvmurthy (#3160)

### Observability
* Cumulative metrics for active I/O threads usage by @deepakrn (#2463)
* Cumulative metric for active main thread usage by @dvkashapov (#2931)

### Bug Fixes
* Restrict ttl from being negative and avoid crash in import-mode by @cjx-zar (#2944)
* Avoid memory leak of new argv when hexpire commands target only non-existing fields by @ranshid (#2973)
* Fix hincrby* update volatile key tracking by @ranshid (#2974)
* Fix chained replica crash when doing dual channel replication by @enjoy-binbin (#2983)
* Fix zero length hash creation with HSETEX by @madolson (#2998)
* Fix HSETEX: replace strcmp with strcasecmp by @frostzt (#3000)
* Fix hash: Untrack hash with volatile fields when it is overwritten by @frostzt (#3003)
* Skip slot cache optimization for AOF client to prevent key duplication and data corruption by @AdityaTeltia (#3004)
* Fix used_memory_dataset underflow due to miscalculated used_memory_overhead by @bpint (#3005)
* HFE make zero a valid ttl during import mode and data loading by @cjx-zar (#3006)
* Fix HRANDFIELD to return null response when no field could be found by @ranshid (#3022)
* Fix HEXPIRE should not delete items when validation rules fail and expiration is in the past by @ranshid (#3048)
* Fix how hash is handling overriding of expired fields overwrite by @ranshid (#3060)
* Don't exit the process when locale-collate fails to be set from env during startup by @enjoy-binbin (#3067)
* Fix use-after-free in generateSyncSlotsEstablishCommand by @twooster (#3283)

### Build and Tooling
* Show RPS histogram in valkey-benchmark by @hanxizh9910 (#2471)
* Add --warmup and --duration parameters to valkey-benchmark by @rainsupreme (#2581)
* Lazy loading of RDMA libs in CLI/Benchmark when building as module by @Ada-Church-Closure (#3072)
* Add cache for COMMAND by @ebarskiy (#2839)

### Other
* Perform data cleanup during RDB load on successful version/signature validation by @ChiliPaneer (#2600)
* Strictly check CRLF when parsing querybuf by @enjoy-binbin (#2872)
* Fail fast on invalid certificates at TLS config load by @yang-z-o (#2999)
* Add support for asynchronous release to replicaKeysWithExpire on writable replica by @Scut-Corgis (#2849)

